<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh tenge rises to 75.5700 to dlr.</title>
<headline>Kazakh tenge rises to 75.5700 to dlr.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tenge closed at 75.5700 per dollar on the Kazakhstan Currency Exchange on Wednesday after 75.6000 on Tuesday.</p>
<p> TENGE PER DOLLAR	     July 9		  July 8</p>
<p> High			     75.8000		 75.6701</p>
<p> Low				75.5400		 75.6000</p>
<p> Open			     75.8000		 75.6000</p>
<p> Close			    75.5700		 75.6000</p>
<p> Volume ($ million)		  3.120		   6.915</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, + 7 3272 509410</p>
